# Welcome flow is FROZEN (RC1 complete)

**Deployed:** 2026-07-05 — PR #46 — `main` @ `eb5bfe3`

## Hard rules

1. **Do NOT** change Welcome show/hide lifecycle, Home action behaviour, or Home icon placement without explicit approval.
2. **Do NOT** implement **Resume Shopping** (RC2) in this repo during RC1 — see Post-RC1 below.
3. Bug fixes only if they restore spec behaviour; no redesigns.

## Frozen behaviour

| Trigger | Welcome |
|---------|---------|
| First browser session visit | Show |
| Home (icon or logo) | Show |
| Search | Hide |
| Category / collection selection | Hide |
| Open product / add to cart | Hide |
| Sort change | **No change** |
| Pagination | **No change** |

**Home action:** clear search, category, filters; reset collection All + sort Featured; restore Welcome; smooth scroll top. **Cart must never be cleared.**

## Key files

- `src/App.jsx` — `showWelcome`, `dismissWelcome`, `goHome`, `WELCOME_DISMISSED_KEY`
- `src/components/MainContent.jsx` — `showWelcome` prop gates `site-hero-banner`
- `src/components/Header.jsx` + `Header.css` — Home icon + logo
- `src/lib/scrollToTop.js` — `scrollToTopSmooth()`

## RC2 (approved, NOT RC1)

**Resume Shopping** — remember browsing context (scroll, category, search) so customer can return exactly where they left off after visiting Welcome. Do not implement until RC2 sprint is approved.
